                [ 'p', 'Besides the Standard Setup variants (F2 alone, F2 with the Slide Extension, Deluxe Bundle), xTool offers On-the-Go Setup variants for work away from the studio: the F2 with the Air Purifier Go, the F2 with the DJI Power 1000 Mini and the F2 On-the-Go Bundle. Check what your chosen set includes before ordering, for example the 24 V cable – we are happy to help.' ],
                [ 'products', '9163846877397' ],
                [ 'h3', 'Working without mains power: DJI Power 1000 Mini and the 24 V cable' ],
                [ 'p', 'At a market or on a stand without power, the F2 can run from a DJI Power 1000 Mini with a capacity of 1 kWh. According to the manufacturer, it recharges from 0 to 80% in 58 minutes and has a built-in 400 W car charger and an MPPT module for solar panels, so you can top it up on the way.' ],
                [ 'p', 'The F2 connects to the station with a dedicated 24 V cable – according to xTool, a loss-free DC-to-DC connection that makes the most of the battery. The manufacturer does not give a run time per charge, as it depends on power, materials and the number of jobs, so test a typical work programme on battery before a full-day event without mains power.' ],
                [ 'h3', 'Smoke and smell: Air Purifier Go' ],
                [ 'p', 'Smoke and smell from wood, leather or acrylic are not welcome in an exhibition hall or a wedding venue. The Air Purifier Go is made for the F2: a backpack-style, pipe-free unit that sits behind the machine, weighs 1.34 kg and uses four-layer filtration to reduce smoke, particles and odours. The filters are easy to replace. It does not replace ventilation, though, so ask the organiser about the rules for indoor venues.' ],
                [ 'products', '9514703192277,9514708762837,9503506563285' ],
