                [ 'p', 'How long one piece takes depends on the size of the text, the material, the power and the number of passes, so it cannot be given in advance. Do a dress rehearsal: engrave every item on your menu and time it – then you know how many pieces per hour you can promise. What shortens the queue:' ],
                [ 'ul', [
                    'A short menu: a few items and two or three fonts. Prepare designs as templates in xTool Creative Space so that on site you only change the name.',
